---
title: "invest (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_period: not paused
    q_check_period --> q_check_prefund: check if in prefund or active sale period
    q_check_prefund --> q_verify_sig: in prefund period (prefundStartTime <= now <= prefundEndTime)
    q_check_period --> q_check_active: not in prefund
    q_check_active --> q_verify_sig: in active sale period (startTime <= now <= endTime)
    q_check_active --> q_revert_timing: outside valid period
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert SaleNotActive
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_amount: signature from authorized Legion signer valid
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_amount --> q_transfer: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: amount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvest
    q_transfer --> q_update_position: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update_position --> q_update_total: position.investedCapital += amount
    q_update_total --> [*]: totalCapitalInvested += amount, emit Invested

    note right of q_verify_sig
        INV-001: only investments with valid Legion signer signatures are accepted
        INV-002: investedCapital monotonically increases per investor during invest
        INV-003: totalCapitalInvested = sum of all individual investedCapital
    end note
